                              SECTION 1 — DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

    "Software" refers to the Optimus Cybersecurity Defense Suite, including
    but not limited to: NetGuard Pro, CleanGuard Pro, MailShield Pro,
    VPN Guard Pro, File Integrity Monitor, SentinelOS SIEM/SOAR, HoneyPot
    Deployer, Network Recorder, StrikeBack Active Defense, Help Agent, and
    all associated configuration files, documentation, and assets.

    "License Key" refers to the unique alphanumeric code provided upon
    purchase or registration that activates and validates the Software.

    "Device" refers to a single physical or virtual machine on which the
    Software is installed.

    "Organization" refers to a single legal entity, including all of its
    subsidiaries and affiliates operating under the same corporate umbrella.

================================================================================
                           SECTION 2 — LICENSING TIERS
================================================================================

    The Software is available under the following licensing tiers. Each tier
    grants specific rights and limitations as described below.

    --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    2.1  COMMUNITY LICENSE (Free of Charge)
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------

         (a)  SCOPE: Grants a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable
              license to use the following programs:

                  - NetGuard Pro (Network Monitor & Packet Analyzer)
                  - CleanGuard Pro (System Cleanup & Optimization)
                  - MailShield Pro (Secure Email Client)
                  - VPN Guard Pro (VPN Management & WireGuard Integration)
                  - File Integrity Monitor (FIM)

         (b)  PERMITTED USE: Personal and educational use only.

         (c)  RESTRICTIONS:
              - No commercial deployment or use in production environments
              - No redistribution in any form
              - No modification of source code
              - Limited to one (1) device per license
              - No access to SentinelOS SIEM/SOAR advanced features

         (d)  SUPPORT: Community forums only. No guaranteed response time.

    --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    2.2  PRO LICENSE ($29.00 USD / Year)
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------

         (a)  SCOPE: Grants a non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use
              ALL fourteen (14) programs included in the Software.

         (b)  PERMITTED USE: Commercial use permitted within a single
              organization.

         (c)  DEVICE LIMIT: Up to five (5) devices per license.

         (d)  DURATION: Valid for twelve (12) months from the date of
              purchase. Renewable annually at the then-current rate.

         (e)  SUPPORT: Standard email support with 72-hour response time
              during business days.

         (f)  UPDATES: All software updates released during the active
              license period are included at no additional cost.

    --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    2.3  EARLY BIRD LICENSE ($14.99 USD — Lifetime)
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------

         (a)  SCOPE: Grants a non-exclusive, non-transferable, perpetual
              license to use ALL fourteen (14) programs included in the
              Software.

         (b)  PERMITTED USE: Commercial use permitted within a single
              organization.

         (c)  DEVICE LIMIT: Up to ten (10) devices per license.

         (d)  DURATION: Lifetime. This license does not expire and includes
              all future versions of the Software at no additional cost.

         (e)  SUPPORT: Priority email support with 48-hour response time
              during business days.

         (f)  AVAILABILITY: Limited to the first five hundred (500)
              purchasers. Once all Early Bird licenses have been sold,
              this tier will no longer be available.

         (g)  SPECIAL CONDITIONS:
              - Non-transferable: Cannot be sold, assigned, or transferred
                to another individual or organization
              - Non-refundable: All sales are final
              - Lifetime updates: Includes all major and minor versions

    --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    2.4  ENTERPRISE LICENSE ($99.00 USD / Year)
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------

         (a)  SCOPE: Grants a non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use
              ALL fourteen (14) programs included in the Software, plus
              advanced SentinelOS SIEM/SOAR features and enterprise
              integrations.

         (b)  PERMITTED USE: Commercial use permitted. Multi-site deployment
              within the licensed organization is allowed.

         (c)  DEVICE LIMIT: Unlimited devices within the licensed
              organization.

         (d)  DURATION: Valid for twelve (12) months from the date of
              purchase. Renewable annually at the then-current rate.

         (e)  SUPPORT:
              - Dedicated support channel
              - Service Level Agreement (SLA): 24-hour response time
              - Custom integration assistance

         (f)  ADDITIONAL FEATURES:
              - Advanced threat intelligence feeds
              - Custom playbook development assistance
              - Multi-site deployment management
              - Centralized logging and reporting

